<article class="env-definition" id="FDE4E7">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/FDE4E7">Definition <span data-tag="FDE4E7">5.4.7.8</span>.</a>accessible!subcategory Let $\calC $ be an accessible category. A full subcategory $\calD \subseteq \calC $ is an <em>accessible subcategory</em> of $\calC $ if $\calD $ is accessible, and the inclusion of $\calD $ into $\calC $ is an accessible functor. </p>
